BT 1 0 0 1 0 74.5 Tm /F1 9.5 Tf 14 TL .234717 Tw (Cheat Engine's workflow: search RAM for a value \(e.g. '150' for 150 HP\). Take a hit and drop to 120 HP. Search) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.810198 Tw (again for '120'. Repeat until one address remains. Set that address to 9999. The player now has 9999 HP) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.078825 Tw (displayed. The countermeasure: never store the actual value at the scanned address. Store an XOR-encoded) Tj T* 0 Tw .117268 Tw (version using a random runtime key. When Cheat Engine finds and modifies '0x5F2A' \(the encoded form of 150\),) Tj T* 0 Tw .019448 Tw (setting it to 9999 will actually produce an absurd decoded value like -31294 \227 and the server immediately rejects) Tj T* 0 Tw (it.) Tj T* ET
